---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: "help_of(&format!(\"{line} -h\"))"
---
Show the workspace event log, newest first.
The server filters it by the query parameters you give with -p.

USAGE
  holst workspace log [<ws>] [flags]

ARGUMENTS
  ws   The workspace: id or part of its name; your only workspace if left out

FLAGS
  -p, --param key=value   A query parameter of the log request, repeatable, e.g. -p limit=50

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst ws log
  $ holst ws log easy -p limit=50

LEARN MORE
  How a workspace is given: `holst ws -h`.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
